  "details": "1. Select an avatar you haven't downloaded yet\n\n2. While it is still downloading, use one of the default gestures (Die, Backflip, etcetc)\n\n3. Once the avatar finishes downloading, you will not be able to use gestures until re-joining the instance\n\n- Tested and confirmed this happens on Desktop and VR modes\n\n- Tested on multiple avatars \n\nIt's a bit of an inconvenience having to re-join a world (especially one you're far away from spawn in) when you accidentally trigger this via muscle memory.",
